          weightedResonantLeadingTailCLM (by norm_num) w N‖ < η := by
  obtain ⟨r,hr,N₀,hN₀,hC⟩ := exists_fixedBall_weightedResonantCenterClosingTail_derivative
    (by norm_num) (by norm_num) w φ η hη
